sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant U as Browser (app.localhost)
    participant T as Traefik
    participant F as UI (Vite)
    participant B as Backend (Elysia)
    participant DB as Postgres
    participant OP as Ollama proxy
    participant OL as Ollama (host)

    U->>T: HTTPS GET https://app.localhost
    T->>F: forward to ui:5173
    F-->>U: HTML / JS bundle

    U->>T: HTTPS POST https://backend.localhost/api/simulations
    T->>B: forward to backend:8000
    B->>DB: INSERT simulation_sets / scenarios
    DB-->>B: rows + caseId
    B-->>T: 201 Created { caseId }
    T-->>U: 201 Created

    U->>T: HTTPS POST https://ollama.localhost/api/chat
    T->>OP: forward to ollama-proxy:80
    OP->>OL: HTTP to host Ollama
    OL-->>OP: streamed completion
    OP-->>T: stream
    T-->>U: stream
